    <bpmn:process id="W_W4521" name="W4521. CSR Impact Measurement, Logic Model &amp; Outcome Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program design; measurement cycle (W4514–W4517); reporting
Frequency: Per program + periodic measurement
Volume: Outcome tracking across all programs/beneficiaries
Owner: Foundation ED / M&amp;E Lead / Data (VS-28)
Participants: Programs, Analytics (VS-28), Partners (W4519), Insights (VS-44)
Source: workflow W4521 — CSR Impact Measurement, Logic Model &amp; Outcome Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4521_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4521_Lane1" name="M&amp;E">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4521_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4521_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4521_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4521_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4521_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4521_Start3" name="Program design; measurement cycle (W4514–W4517); reporting">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4521_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4521_Task4" name="M&amp;E/Foundation ED build the logic model / theory of change per program (inputs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: M&amp;E/Foundation ED build the logic model / theory of change per program (inputs → activities → outputs → outcomes → impact) and define indicators (IRIS+/SMART) before launch
Responsible (R): M&amp;E / Foundation ED / Programs
Accountable (A): Foundation Board Programs Committee
Duration: Per program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4521_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4521_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4521_Task5" name="M&amp;E/Partners collect output/outcome data (beneficiaries reached, houses built…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: M&amp;E/Partners collect output/outcome data (beneficiaries reached, houses built, income gained, enterprises surviving) on the CSR data platform (W4512), with data quality
Responsible (R): M&amp;E / Partners / Data
Accountable (A): Foundation ED
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4521_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4521_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4521_Task6" name="M&amp;E/Foundation ED analyze outcomes vs targets, capture beneficiary feedback…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: M&amp;E/Foundation ED analyze outcomes vs targets, capture beneficiary feedback (VS-44/W4525), and report to the board (VS-36) and into SROI (W4522)
Responsible (R): M&amp;E / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): Foundation Board
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4521_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4521_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4521_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4521_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4521_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-165 (ensure CSR / foundation governance &amp; safeguarding.) | - CTL-688: programs have logic model &amp; outcome indicators pre-launch; data quality managed; outcomes (not vanity metrics) reported
Owner: Foundation ED / M&amp;E Lead / Data (VS-28)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4521_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4521_Annotation8" targetRef="W4521_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
