    <bpmn:process id="W_W4522" name="W4522. Social Return on Investment (SROI) &amp; Benefit Valuation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Portfolio review; investment decision; reporting
Frequency: Periodic + per major program
Volume: SROI/benefit valuation across the CSR portfolio
Owner: Foundation ED / Finance (VS-17.4) / M&amp;E
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4), Strategy (VS-33), Analytics (VS-28), Programs
Source: workflow W4522 — Social Return on Investment (SROI) &amp; Benefit Valuation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4522_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4522_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4522_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4522_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4522_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4522_Lane2" name="Foundation ED">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4522_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4522_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4522_Start4" name="Portfolio review; investment decision; reporting">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4522_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4522_Task5" name="Finance/M&amp;E/Foundation ED value social outcomes monetarily (SROI methodology —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance/M&amp;E/Foundation ED value social outcomes monetarily (SROI methodology — housing value, income gain, avoided disaster cost) using outcome data (W4521) and standard proxies
Responsible (R): Finance / M&amp;E / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): CFO / Foundation Board
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4522_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4522_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4522_Task6" name="Foundation ED/Strategy compare SROI across programs/geographies, informing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Foundation ED/Strategy compare SROI across programs/geographies, informing portfolio allocation (W4508) and investment decisions
Responsible (R): Foundation ED / Strategy / Finance
Accountable (A): Foundation Board
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4522_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4522_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4522_Task7" name="Finance/Foundation ED report SROI to the board (VS-36) and integrate into CSR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Foundation ED report SROI to the board (VS-36) and integrate into CSR reporting (W4523), with methodology transparency (avoid over-claiming)
Responsible (R): Finance / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): CFO / Foundation Board
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4522_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4522_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4522_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4522_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4522_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-688 (ensure controlled execution — CSR Impact Measurement, Reporting &amp; Stakeholder Engagement (PA-152.3).) | - CTL-688: SROI conservatively valued w/ methodology disclosed; multi-criteria allocation; board-reported (VS-36)
Owner: Foundation ED / Finance (VS-17.4) / M&amp;E</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4522_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4522_Annotation9" targetRef="W4522_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4522_Flow11" sourceRef="W4522_Start4" targetRef="W4522_Task5" />
