    <bpmn:process id="W_W4523" name="W4523. CSR/ESG/Sustainability Reporting (GRI, IRIS+, Integrated Reporting)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting cycle (annual/ESG); disclosure requirement
Frequency: Annual + on request
Volume: CSR/ESG disclosure (GRI social indicators, IRIS+, integrated report)
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / Foundation ED / ESG (VS-25) / Reporting (VS-17.4)
Participants: ESG (VS-25), HR (VS-103), Sustainability (VS-25.2), Compliance (VS-22), Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4523 — CSR/ESG/Sustainability Reporting (GRI, IRIS+, Integrated Reporting)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4523_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4523_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
