        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-688 (ensure controlled execution — CSR Impact Measurement, Reporting &amp; Stakeholder Engagement (PA-152.3).) | - CTL-688: social disclosure accurate &amp; assured (VS-21); data-traceable (W4512); greenwashing-controlled (W4527)
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / Foundation ED / ESG (VS-25) / Reporting (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
