    <bpmn:process id="W_W4528" name="W4528. CSR Continuous Improvement, Learning &amp; Portfolio Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Portfolio review; outcome data; OpEx (VS-133)
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: CSR portfolio review across all programs
Owner: Foundation ED / Sustainability/ESG Manager / Strategy (VS-33)
Participants: M&amp;E, Programs, Finance (VS-17.4), OpEx (VS-133), Board (VS-36)
Source: workflow W4528 — CSR Continuous Improvement, Learning &amp; Portfolio Review</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4528_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4528_Lane1" name="Foundation ED">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4528_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4528_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4528_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4528_Lane2" name="Programs">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4528_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4528_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4528_Start4" name="Portfolio review; outcome data; OpEx (VS-133)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4528_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4528_Task5" name="Foundation ED/M&amp;E review the portfolio against strategy (W4505), outcomes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Foundation ED/M&amp;E review the portfolio against strategy (W4505), outcomes (W4521), and SROI (W4522), identifying high/low performers and learning
Responsible (R): Foundation ED / M&amp;E / Strategy
Accountable (A): Foundation Board
Duration: Quarterly/Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4528_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4528_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4528_Task6" name="Programs/Foundation ED apply learnings (scale high-impact, redesign/exit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Programs/Foundation ED apply learnings (scale high-impact, redesign/exit low-impact), align to OpEx continuous-improvement (VS-133), and reallocate budget (W4508)
Responsible (R): Programs / Foundation ED / Finance
Accountable (A): Foundation Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4528_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4528_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4528_Task7" name="Foundation ED/Sustainability Lead capture institutional learning (what works in…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Foundation ED/Sustainability Lead capture institutional learning (what works in PH community context), report portfolio health/decisions to the board (VS-36), and feed strategy (W4505)
Responsible (R): Foundation ED / Sustainability Lead
Accountable (A): Foundation Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4528_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4528_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4528_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4528_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4528_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-688 (ensure controlled execution — CSR Impact Measurement, Reporting &amp; Stakeholder Engagement (PA-152.3).) | - CTL-688: portfolio reviewed vs outcomes/SROI (W4521/W4522); low-impact exited; learnings captured; board-reported (VS-36)
Owner: Foundation ED / Sustainability/ESG Manager / Strategy (VS-33)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
